'''Vahlok the Jailor''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest|dragon priest]] entombed within [[Skyrim:Vahlok's Tomb|Vahlok's Tomb]] in [[Skyrim:Solstheim|Solstheim]]. He was once the ruler of Solstheim, tasked with watching over the traitor, [[Skyrim:Miraak (person)|Miraak]], after discovering Miraak's plot against their masters and defeating him in an epic battle.

Vahlok knows a variety of spells, including [[Skyrim:Ebonyflesh|Ebonyflesh]], [[Skyrim:Command Daedra|Command Daedra]], [[Skyrim:Conjure Flame Atronach|Conjure Flame Atronach]], [[Skyrim:Fireball|Fireball]], [[Skyrim:Flame Cloak|Flame Cloak]], [[Skyrim:Incinerate|Incinerate]], and [[Skyrim:Greater Ward|Greater Ward]].
