== Notes ==
* The story of Vahlok and Miraak is described in more detail in ''[[Skyrim:The Guardian and the Traitor|The Guardian and the Traitor]]''.
* Vahlok means "guardian" in the [[Lore:Dragon Language|dragon language]]. It's featured on the first [[Skyrim:Word_Wall#Unrelenting_Force|Word Wall of the Unrelenting Force shout.]]
* Vahlok is the only named dragon priest who does not have an eponymous mask.
* Many internal references refer to him by the name "'''Toldar'''".

